{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_joining_and_seeds_join_handshake", "label": "Join-Handshake", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Der Joiner kontaktiert einen Seed, wird als joining per Gossip propagiert und wechselt zu up, sobald der Leader ihn sieht und Konvergenz eintritt.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/joining-and-seeds.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_joining_and_seeds_seeds", "label": "Seed-Liste", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Nur ein Bootstrap-Hinweis \u2014 nach dem Join lernt der Node alle Peers per Gossip, Seeds sind danach nichts Besonderes mehr. Eine leere Liste heisst 'ich bin der erste'.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/joining-and-seeds.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_joining_and_seeds_selfelection", "label": "selfElection", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Bestimmt, wann ein Node allein einen Cluster bilden darf: immediate nur bei leerer Seed-Liste, never, oder eine Frist in Millisekunden \u2014 gesetzt vom Cluster-Bootstrap.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/joining-and-seeds.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_joining_and_seeds_seedretryintervalms", "label": "seedRetryIntervalMs", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Loest das Problem eines Seeds, der irgendwann erreichbar ist \u2014 ein erstes Mitglied kann die Schleife nicht herbeizaubern.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/joining-and-seeds.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_joining_and_seeds_symmetric_seed_list", "label": "Die symmetrische Seed-Liste startet nicht kalt", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Cluster entfernt die eigene Adresse, also bleibt keinem Node die leere Liste, die selfElection immediate verlangt; jeder bleibt fuer immer joining, es gibt keinen Leader, und der Leader ist es, der joining zu up befoerdert.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/joining-and-seeds.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_joining_and_seeds_kubernetesapiseedprovider", "label": "KubernetesApiSeedProvider", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/joining-and-seeds.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_joining_and_seeds_selfup", "label": "SelfUp", "file_type": "code", "rationale": "Feuert einmal, wenn dieser Node auf up uebergeht \u2014 das nuetzliche Gate fuer Arbeit, die Cluster-Mitgliedschaft erfordert.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/joining-and-seeds.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_joining_and_seeds_hostname_ip_mismatch", "label": "Hostname-vs-IP-Mismatch", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Die Mitglieder-Identitaet ist die beim Join angegebene Adresse; sehen Peers verschiedene Adressen fuer denselben Node, bildet sich der Cluster, aber jeder sieht den Peer als Fremden.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/joining-and-seeds.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_joining_and_seeds_two_clusters_same_name", "label": "Zwei Cluster mit demselben Namen", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Eine Partition beim Start laesst getrennte Cluster entstehen, und Gossip merged sie nach dem Heilen nicht automatisch \u2014 abzumildern mit einer Downing-Strategie und dem Cluster-Bootstrap.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/joining-and-seeds.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_joining_and_seeds_join_handshake", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_joining_and_seeds_seeds", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/joining-and-seeds.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_joining_and_seeds_seeds", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_joining_and_seeds_seedretryintervalms", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/joining-and-seeds.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_joining_and_seeds_seeds", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_joining_and_seeds_selfelection", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/joining-and-seeds.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_joining_and_seeds_symmetric_seed_list", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_joining_and_seeds_selfelection", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/joining-and-seeds.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_joining_and_seeds_kubernetesapiseedprovider", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_joining_and_seeds_seeds", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/joining-and-seeds.